nments</li>\\n</ul>\\n</dd>\\n<dt>pairwise_identity (alias: pairwise_id, pi)</dt>\\n<dd><ul class=\\\"first last simple\\\">\\n<li>calculates average pairwise identify among sequences in\\nan alignment file. This is a proxy for evolutionary rate</li>\\n</ul>\\n</dd>\\n<dt>parsimony_informative_sites (alias: pis)</dt>\\n<dd><ul class=\\\"first last simple\\\">\\n<li>calculates the number and percentage of parsimony\\ninformative sites in an alignment</li>\\n</ul>\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n</div>\\n\",\n  \"help_format\": \"restructuredtext\",\n  \"hidden\": \"\",\n  \"hidden_versions\": [],\n  \"history_id\": \"bbd44e69cb8906b56cc85b035b616ce5\",\n  \"icon\": null,\n  \"id\": \"toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/padge/phykit/phykit_alignment_based/0.1.0\",\n  \"inputs\": [\n    {\n      \"cases\": [\n        {\n          \"inputs\": [\n            {\n              \"argument\": null,\n              \"default_value\": {\n                \"values\": [\n                  {\n                    \"id\": \"f9cad7b01a47213501b36a2264ed6674\",\n                    \"src\": \"hda\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              \"edam\": {\n                \"edam_data\": [\n                  \"data_2044\"\n                ],\n                \"edam_formats\": [\n                  \"format_1929\"\n                ]\n              },\n              \"extensions\": [\n                \"fasta\"\n              ],\n              \"help\": \"\",\n              \"help_format\": \"html\",\n              \"hidden\": false,\n              \"is_dynamic\": false,\n              \"label\": \"alignment list file. File should contain a single column list of alignment sequence files to concatenate into a single matrix.\",\n              \"max\": null,\n              \"min\": null,\n              \"model_class\": \"DataToolParameter\",\n              \"multiple\": true,\n              \"name\": \"input1\",\n              \"optional\": false,\n              \"options\": {\n         